		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Rare Gloves</strong> &middot; <strong>Price:</strong> 2,000 g</p><p><em>Velvety gloves inscribed with arcane patterns.</em></p><hr><p>Your unarmed strikes deal <strong>1d4+Arcana Force damage</strong>.</p><p><strong>Infusion.</strong> When you make an unarmed strike, you may spend mana up to your highest spell tier to empower that attack. For each mana spent this way, that attack gains KEY damage and increments die size one step (1d4 &gt; 1d6 &gt; &hellip; &gt; 1d20).</p><p><em>Activate to roll an (optionally infused) strike — the dialog spends the mana and builds the formula for you.</em></p><p class=\"nim-plus-credit\"><em>&mdash; Malikua, Nim+ Volume IV</em></p>",
